{{ m.h(2, '1. Purpose and design') }}
{{ m.p('Stage 2 compares the two randomised pilot arms (B_fixed: micro-game carousel; A_narrative: three linked episodes), randomised 1:1 within quota cells (language x age band x gender x education band x literacy band). Both arms complete criterion block X plus one rotating block, the performance tasks, at fixed calibration level L2. The live-dyad substudy and the forced-level subsample run in parallel.') }}
{{ m.p('Analysis order: descriptives and data quality; reliability by indicator kind; criterion-scale invariance across languages and modes (before any game-criterion correlation is interpreted); convergent lower-bound tests and discriminant pattern statistics on observed r; the B vs A comparison; completion and play-again against targets.') }}
{% if tg %}
{{ m.p('Registered decision thresholds used in this report (gates.yaml): convergent lower bound > ' ~ (tg.convergent.lower_bound_gt | num) ~ ' (' ~ tg.convergent.correction ~ '-corrected for the primary family, observed r only, correct sign required); composite reliability point >= ' ~ (tg.reliability.point_min | num) ~ ' with lower bound >= ' ~ (tg.reliability.lower_bound_min | num) ~ '.') }}
{% endif %}
{{ m.callout('note', 'Stage 2 exit rule', 'Stage 2 produces provisional indicator flags only. There are no drops and no dictionary v2 freeze; Stage 3 runs on the same frozen v1 build.') }}

